    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say things get better but what if they dont? what if this is just how it is? it feels like i'm just stuck in this loop and there's no actual exit except for just... stopping. does that even make sense? like, is it really so wrong to want the noise to just stop for good?",
